@host = http://localhost:5080
@adminKey = {{$dotenv SIRKADIYEN_ADMIN__API_KEY}}

### The revisions validation is holding for review.
GET {{host}}/api/revisions?state=ReviewRequired&limit=50
X-Admin-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### One revision with the findings that explain its state.
GET {{host}}/api/revisions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
X-Admin-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Approve a quarantined revision and publish it.
### Both fields are stored against the revision as its audit trail.
POST {{host}}/api/revisions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/approve
X-Admin-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approvedBy": "semih",
  "approvalReason": "Checked the source: the drop is the exam period, not a parse fault."
}

### The diffs the dispatch gate is holding.
GET {{host}}/api/diffs?state=Held&limit=50
X-Admin-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### One diff with the changes behind its hold, deletions first.
GET {{host}}/api/diffs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000?entryLimit=100
X-Admin-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Release a held diff for dispatch.
### Refused with 409 when the hold is ambiguity: that is fixed at the source.
POST {{host}}/api/diffs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/release
X-Admin-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "releasedBy": "semih",
  "releaseReason": "Checked the source: the 38 deleted lessons are the ended anatomy block."
}

### The OpenAPI document, for importing into Postman.
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
